        <mxCell id="summary" parent="1" value="DATA FLOW PATH:&#10;&#10;1. INBOUND: Driver -&gt; Cloudflare -&gt; Internet GW -&gt; ALB -&gt; Istio Ingress -&gt; Kong -&gt; Gateway -&gt; Services&#10;2. OUTBOUND: Services in private subnet -&gt; NAT Gateway -&gt; Internet (for external API calls)&#10;3. INTER-SERVICE: All gRPC with Istio mTLS, L7 load balanced (LEAST_CONN)&#10;4. ASYNC EVENTS: Reservation/Billing -&gt; RabbitMQ (consistent hash by spot_id) -&gt; Notification + Analytics&#10;5. DATA: Each service owns its DB (no cross-service FK). Search uses Read Replica + Redis cache&#10;6. PAYMENT: Payment -&gt; Settlement stub via HTTP with sony/gobreaker circuit breaker&#10;&#10;PUBLIC SUBNET ROLES:&#10;- Internet Gateway: Entry point for inbound traffic from internet&#10;- ALB: L7 load balancer, HTTPS termination, routes to EKS&#10;- NAT Gateway: Allows private subnet resources to reach internet (outbound only, no inbound)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=9;strokeColor=#999999;fillColor=#FAFAFA;rounded=1;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="160" y="1260" width="900" height="200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>